%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 22d0308a90dc49ae97395f1b651723b5, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_COMM_05_ProvingValue
  questionId: COMM-05
  category: 2
  speakerName: Sales Director
  questionText: >-
    The VP asks how you will prove value in ninety days without promising a breach will not happen. What do you say?
  answerOptions:
  - {fileID: 11400001}
  - {fileID: 11400002}
  - {fileID: 11400003}
  - {fileID: 11400004}
--- !u!114 &11400001
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_COMM_05_A1
  answerText: >-
    Define measurable leading indicators such as coverage gaps closed, analyst time saved, and executive risk evidence produced.
  technicalDelta: 1
  commercialDelta: 3
  rapportDelta: 1
  energyDelta: -1
--- !u!114 &11400002
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_COMM_05_A2
  answerText: >-
    Explain that breach prevention is the ultimate value and the platform materially reduces that likelihood.
  technicalDelta: 1
  commercialDelta: 1
  rapportDelta: -1
  energyDelta: 0
--- !u!114 &11400003
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_COMM_05_A3
  answerText: >-
    Offer a conservative success plan and say you will not claim outcomes the telemetry cannot prove.
  technicalDelta: 2
  commercialDelta: 1
  rapportDelta: 2
  energyDelta: -2
--- !u!114 &11400004
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_COMM_05_A4
  answerText: >-
    Ask what value story the VP needs for the board, then back into the proof points from that story.
  technicalDelta: 0
  commercialDelta: 3
  rapportDelta: 2
  energyDelta: 0
